{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014ShjYGF32PCm7VMjXJEJ9u","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Claude Pro plan price per month US\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Claude Code Pricing & Plans (2026): Subscription Cost, Pro $20, Max $100/$200, API\",\"url\":\"https://www.morphllm.com/claude-code-pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Code Pricing 2026: Plans, Limits, and Hidden Costs\",\"url\":\"https://www.superblocks.com/blog/claude-code-pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Pricing 2026: Every Plan, Cost and Verdict\",\"url\":\"https://www.nocode.mba/articles/claude-pricing-2026\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Pro pricing: cost per month and limits · SSD Nodes\",\"url\":\"https://www.ssdnodes.com/learn/claude-pro-price-and-limits\"},{\"title\":\"Claude AI Pricing: Pro & Max Subscription Plans in Sept 2026\",\"url\":\"https://suprmind.ai/hub/claude/pricing/\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Pricing in 2026: Plans, API Costs, and Is It Worth It?\",\"url\":\"https://geotoolbox.ai/blog/claude-pricing\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Pricing 2026: Free vs Pro vs Team Plans Compared\",\"url\":\"https://thecrunch.io/claude-pricing/\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Pro price 2026: $20/month. Pro, Max or Team?\",\"url\":\"https://www.claudecoworkexpert.com/en/pricing/\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Pro Pricing: What You Actually Get in 2026\",\"url\":\"https://aionx.co/claude-ai-reviews/claude-pro-pricing/\"}]\n\nClaude Pro costs **$20 per month** when billed monthly in the US. Paying annually brings the effective price down to **$17 per month**, billed as a single $200 payment.\n\nSeveral sources agree on this. One says the monthly rate is $20 and the annual option works out to $17 a month. Those are the figures on Anthropic's pricing page as of 16 October 2026, when this page was last checked. Another lists the annual plan as $200 paid up front, rounded to $17 per month, against $20 monthly. Those prices are USD web prices, excluding applicable taxes.\n\nPrices can differ b